{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ticket Booking API (end of Phase 5)",
    "description": "END OF PHASE 5 (security). Run in this order:\n1. Auth > Login as ADMIN. Then Movies > Create Movie, Shows > Create Show.\n2. Auth > Login as USER. Then Seats > Get Seats By Show, Bookings > Create Booking, Get Booking.\n3. Ownership: Auth > Register second USER, Login as second USER. Then Bookings > Get Booking and Cancel Booking should return 403.\n4. Roles: with the USER token, Movies > Create Movie should return 403. Login as ORGANIZER and it returns 201.\n5. Tokens: Auth > Refresh Token returns a new pair. Sending the old refresh token again returns 401. Logout returns 204.\nVariables (token, refreshToken, movieId, showId, seatId1, seatId2, bookingId) are saved by test scripts.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "movieId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "showId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "seatId1",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "seatId2",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "bookingId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (USER)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rahul\",\n  \"email\": \"Rahul@Test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 created, or 409 if already registered', function () { pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as ADMIN (saves token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@ticket.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', pm.response.json().refreshToken);",
                  "console.log('Token saved (admin)');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as USER (saves token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
